      "mergeID": "5b6a33dca8921573b335f32a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Specifically, the chess table and the block table that uses the same model. It's uncomfortable for regular-sized avatars (such as Unity-chan) to get a good view of the chessboard, and smaller (but still human-sized) avatars can only see somewhat-clearly by shoving their head into the table looking up. Stacking the bronze blocks is also difficult for the same reason.\nI believe the octagonal table in the mirror room to be the ideal size.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[2018.2.3] Certain tables in the Hub are too tall.",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5b661688c6837c49aed2dccf",
