      "mergeID": "5b6a339c662c963c11a4de4e",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I really love the new hub. It's very comfy, especially the water area!\n\n1: you can see the nametags in the mirror in the new hub. disabling the UI in the mirror fixes this. also, if the mirror is set to 8 anti alias this should be set to 1 to save performance\n\n2: the ring you can sit on in the new hub collides with player or player local layer. this makes it really jumpy when you sit on it\n\n3: the far clip of the voice seems too short. people get quiet very quickly\n\n4: the chess board is too hard to remember which piece is which since none of them have any traditional icons to identify what they are\n\n5: There is an open grass field by the water that would be an amazing place for the campfire. in the first hub, this was the 2nd favorite spot to be at after the mirror!",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[2018.2.3] New Hub Feedback",
