      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": ". Currently, the balcony area outside of the mirror area only has two chairs. It's fairly empty in that area and could use some furnishing.\n\n. The featured portal area switches between worlds without prior warning. There should be a timer that'll show when the world will switch, similar to the random world portal.",
