  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-08-04T21:11:36.483Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": ". Currently, any object that can be picked up in the new Hub can be taken anywhere, including outside the map, and can be thrown out of the reach of avatars. There should be a reset button for these objects.\n\n. Above the random world area, the actual portal to the world is still visible\n\n. There is lighting on the walls, but there is no model for the lights. ",
